Date: Fri, 9 Oct 2026 00:17:16 +0200
Subject: [PATCH 39/65] P5c: CoD 4-post crosshair bloom with ADS post fade.

Gap opens with fire spread and move speed; crouch tightens; sprint fades
posts. ADS fades the posts while cod_adsCrosshair 1 keeps the center dot.
---
